{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呜呜呜、美羽学姐～～”", "text_idx": 236, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 328, "voice": "sn1715", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“纱凪，稍微冷静一下啦。你是想搞砸天羽学姐毕业的气氛吗？”", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 321, "voice": "ar4507", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“可是……可是……”", "text_idx": 235, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 328, "voice": "sn1716", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "美羽学姐的毕业典礼结束后，全体社员都聚在一起祝福她。", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "由于聚餐有点困难，所以大家就决定之后去学姐的家里庆祝一番了。", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "当然，最后会是我跟学姐两人独处……", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“咿咕、咿咕……今天要跟美羽学姐、一直在一起呜呜呜。”", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 328, "voice": "sn1717", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "嗯，好像没办法了。", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔呼呼，虽然毕业了，但我还是会去社团玩的，不要寂寞喔～”", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 331, "voice": "mu2473", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我好寂寞。没有美羽学姐的灰色校园生活……呜啊啊！”", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 328, "voice": "sn1718", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪抱头痛哭。", "text_idx": 329, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看来这个后遗症还会持续一段时间。", "text_idx": 325, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……哥哥，今天没有打工吗？”", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 317, "voice": "sk1347", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，今天排休了。”", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学园合并正式决定了，今年春天起我们就是“结姬学园”的学生。", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然今年开始有分配到社团经费，但是身为社长，我还是想为了动物们工作。", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学姐说备品的费用她要出，但我跟纱凪当然是拒绝了。", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不能总是依赖美羽学姐。", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "也是为了让我们的社团能延续下去。", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哼嗯，你有在打工啊？”", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 321, "voice": "ar4508", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“才刚开始而已。”", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不久前，我开始在车站前的执事吃茶店打工，一周３天。", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "自己也实际过着这样的生活后，我再次了解到美羽学姐令人敬佩的地方。", "text_idx": 334, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不是被人命令要这么做。", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以学姐才没有主动说希望我当社长吧。", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我跟她说了打工的事情后，美羽学姐的表情看起来有点高兴又有点烦恼。", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘没问题的，因为是我自己决定的。’", "text_idx": 229, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我这样说之后，学姐突然哭了出来。", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "那是跟与熊喵分别时不同的，带着笑容的泪水。", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 331, "voice": "mu2474", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而且现在，那个人依然带着不变的笑容在我身边。", "text_idx": 333, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们约好明年我毕业的时候就同居。", "text_idx": 307, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过在那之前我也会经常前往学姐的家，两人相处的时间应该不会减少太多。", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "让大家担心了。", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名同学、安洁、樱乃、隼太、还有纱凪……", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "如果没有大家，就没有现在的我和美羽学姐。", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学姐一定也是这么想的。", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──不是一个人，有大家在。", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "还有熊喵也在守护着我们。", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好了，我们也差不多该走了吧？”", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 328, "voice": "sn1720", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“说的也是。”", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 321, "voice": "ar4510", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯。”", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 317, "voice": "sk1349", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“遵命！”", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 296, "voice": "ag3470", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯？要去学姐家的话，大家一起……”", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我才说到一半，所有人就动作一致地摇头。", "text_idx": 308, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看来是在体贴我们。", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "直到最近我才注意到。", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一开始让我呼吸困难的这所学园的空气，不知不觉中已经变得如此舒适。", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "森林的气味，以及融洽的人们的温度。", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "好像随处可见但并不是。", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这里，这所学园，有想要保护的重要东西。", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……喂，新吾。”", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 328, "voice": "sn1722", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后，新交到的我的‘好友’──", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 328, "voice": "sn1723", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "自然地对上视线。", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她率先露出了笑容。", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我们是很忙的。只剩下今天能亲热了喔！”", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 328, "voice": "sn1724", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后她飒爽地转身。", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“明天开始，你就要以环境保护社的社长身份开始忙了。”", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 328, "voice": "sn1725", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“纱凪……”", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪走在所有人的前方。", "text_idx": 330, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她没有注意到吧。", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘……结果，虽然我没办法成为像美羽学姐那样的人。’", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "说了那样的话的她。", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "挺直的背和美羽学姐一样，坚强而温柔。", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学姐也信任地看着她。", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以我也目送着那个背影直到看不见大家。", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 331, "voice": "mu2477", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "确认四周没有其他人在看后，学姐牵起我的手。", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "像这样穿着制服相处的日子，今天是最后一天了。", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "其实，我还想跟学姐一起度过校园生活的。", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "想跟她两个人，在这个地方创造更多的回忆。", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“如果能更早一点跟美羽学姐相遇的话……”", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯。”", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 331, "voice": "mu2478", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“如果能更早相遇的话？”", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 331, "voice": "mu2479", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学姐有点坏心眼地笑着问。", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她一定明白。", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们两人的“答案”是一样的。", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……不，就算更早相遇结果也会是相同的。”", "text_idx": 231, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，相同呢♪”", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 331, "voice": "mu2480", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "还是会两个人一起迎来今天这个日子。", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "与学姐之间的回忆，今后也能继续创造。", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是，只有一件事。", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "如果真的有神明存在的话。", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 331, "voice": "mu2481", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "希望能让这个望着远方森林的人，有机会与熊喵创造回忆。", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "再一次就好，希望能让她能抱抱熊喵。", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……再见了，小熊喵。”", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 331, "voice": "mu2482", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“！？”", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "小声的道别之后，美羽学姐深深吸了一口气。", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“小熊喵，要保重喔──────！”", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 331, "voice": "mu2483", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "仿佛山谷间的回音。", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我也大喊了出来。", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "与其向神明祈求，这个人的心意……", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“熊喵，保重喔────────！！”", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她的心意一定能传达给熊喵。", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“走吧，新吾君！”", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 331, "voice": "mu2484", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是的。”", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学姐神采奕奕地迈出步伐。", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们交握的手大大的摆荡。", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“对了对了，我有件事想拜托新吾君。”", "text_idx": 248, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 331, "voice": "mu2485", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“怎么了？”", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，就是啊……”", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 331, "voice": "mu2486", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们不会再停滞不前……", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们朝着前方迈进，偶尔两个人一起回头重温走过的路。", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我想跟新吾君一起……今后，被许多猫咪们围绕着生活。”", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 331, "voice": "mu2487", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“跟重要的你。”", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 331, "voice": "mu2488", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“跟最喜欢的孩子们一起，永远、永远──”", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 331, "voice": "mu2489", "char_id": "みう"}]}
